{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>45歲TVB花旦陳自瑤近日憑熱播劇《玫瑰戰爭》人氣急升，戲外她卻突然遠赴江西山區果園，更在鏡頭前情緒失控當場落 …</p><p></p>\n<p>45歲TVB花旦陳自瑤近日憑熱播劇《玫瑰戰爭》人氣急升，戲外她卻突然遠赴江西山區果園，更在鏡頭前情緒失控當場落淚。她親身了解當地果農面臨滯銷困境後，不但放下明星身段親自搬貨到街頭擺檔，更作出一個極具震撼力承諾。這位當紅女星在深山中展現出令人震撼破格一面。</p>\n<h2>深入江西山區果園陳自瑤聞辛酸史當場落淚</h2>\n<p>陳自瑤打扮樸素親身深入江西山區滿山橙樹果園，與當地一位30多歲果農小哥進行深度交談。當她一邊試食新鮮摘下臍橙，一邊聆聽對方娓娓道出種植艱辛以及面臨滯銷與收入微薄無奈時，感性一面瞬間爆發。她忍不住當場眼濕濕落淚，內心充滿自責並向對方坦言「我真的覺得自己很沒用」及「我真的很想幫助他們」，隨後不斷安慰果農小哥表示「可以的可以的」，展現出強烈同理心。</p>\n<h2>零片酬化身義工陳自瑤霸氣包底承擔全數虧損</h2>\n<p>面對果農小哥年紀輕輕便承受沉重生活壓力，陳自瑤決定以實際行動介入事件，毫不猶豫向對方提出「既然我來了，我幫你一起去賣果好不好」。即使對方坦言無法支付薪金，她亦強硬回覆「無所謂啦，不收錢不收錢，義工好嗎」。她不但親力親為採摘及合力抬起一箱箱橙搬運上車，更親自跟隨果農到街頭賣橙，並霸氣承諾「我不知道我可以收多少的橙子，我覺得我能收多少就多少，就算最後賣不了這麼多，虧的是我沒關係，但是起碼他們可以賺點錢」，以專業態度處理這場銷售危機。</p>\n<h2>憑熱播劇集《玫瑰戰爭》關子盈一角演技備受肯定</h2>\n<p>這次助農行動與陳自瑤近期在螢幕上形象形成強烈反差，她近日在台慶劇《玫瑰戰爭》中飾演影后關子盈，劇中慘被好姊妹接連出賣及陷害，超虐心重頭戲獲得極大迴響。雖然她近期忙於為劇集四出宣傳，但依然堅持抽空參與公益活動，有別於多數藝人只留在舒適直播間賣貨，她選擇親自走入崎嶇山區體驗農民生活。她隨後更在直播間附送親筆簽名照催谷銷量，全力協助果農將所有農產品售出。</p>\n<h2>網民激讚落力帶貨網上掀起搶購熱潮引發熱議</h2>\n<p>事件曝光後迅速在各大社交平台發酵，大批網民對陳自瑤真情流露給予高度評價，紛紛湧入留言區表達支持。有網民表示「親自去山區幫手真係好難得」、「睇得出佢係真心想幫人落淚那一幕好感人」，亦有觀眾將焦點放在她行動力上，留言直指「包底呢個承諾真係好霸氣」、「親身搬貨完全無明星架子」。大批粉絲隨後在網上表明會以實際行動購買農產品，直接促成該批水果在短時間內獲得大量訂單。</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179497442448864215_4364913976afd22d92ed7e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"1p5FZoW66d4GVAtoyQ6p-I5xbGbU6R0tlJ2oRpSdqEY.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179497442448864215_4364913976afd22d92ed7e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>深入江西山區果園（圖片來源：小紅書）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179497442749192712_2778010606afd22dc0fc36.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"U8Rjjd5hui6yCgr_BLcyA9F3USToWoHbX32Mzl99jM4.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179497442749192712_2778010606afd22dc0fc36.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>陳自瑤聞辛酸史當場落淚（圖片來源：小紅書）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17949744296008918_5754128906afd22ddedc10.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"RWda1v-7wO_zYufHB9C45yxSBHYXe4No-guecvoLnnI.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17949744296008918_5754128906afd22ddedc10.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：小紅書）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179497443188145273_13405226386afd22e0e81c2.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"C8ZchllGRLh1KELGnPZYQpWWC-5AgxPUNmazZzZms2c.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179497443188145273_13405226386afd22e0e81c2.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：小紅書）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17949744353537094_5716941276afd22e3cf83e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"_VT41lLLBy0kiuQtfXo2hxZlcXvDA58WB7jO8ge4zvI.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17949744353537094_5716941276afd22e3cf83e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>零片酬化身義工（圖片來源：小紅書）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%8a%a9%e8%be%b2%e8%a1%8c%e5%8b%95/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">助農行動</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%8e%ab%e7%91%b0%e6%88%b0%e7%88%ad/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">玫瑰戰爭</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%99%b3%e8%87%aa%e7%91%a4/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">陳自瑤</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3545133\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 18 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T05:26:03.733440+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1410,"images":5,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T04:00:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T07:21:16.423794+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T05:19:34.491205+00:00","content_hash":"b14a01829f82acf0ecc1bebd77dd5c55caa40f1eaa20762480ea1b36d0fa0f2d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}